<title>UK: DePfa unit sets 1.5 billion FRF 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa unit sets 1.5 billion FRF 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    18.NOV.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.518   PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.918    SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    PARIS/LON PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OAT DUE OCT.2008  NOTES    **US/GB/FR/NL/DE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
